{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "04eee66fd7450a58340c0b9b939a3e14e294bc188172cbe70fa167ef5a546f34", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影後", "zh": "写真工作　拍摄后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9000_place", "source_sha256": "d32d1fd121319ef1a706f847706b4316a48c8396a270e2db3269744661d33a53", "ja": "繁華街", "zh": "闹区", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9001_p", "source_sha256": "2cc479cac1b29c861d7599dc2c457de8f02f17a6cd5b31b6bb6a47f3fa888f1e", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が終了。\n真は『一途系女子』にとてもノリノリだったな）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄结束了。\n真似乎非常投入《专情系女子》这个主题呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9002_006mak", "source_sha256": "068a50da50d3e5d406d97173360ed1dcff63465528212c86f4849639c3876c22", "ja": "今日はボクの全力を詰め込みました！ だって、単純に\nカワイイだけじゃ表現できないコンセプトですからね。", "zh": "今天我可是把全部实力都拿出来了！毕竟，这个概念可不是光靠可爱就能表现出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9003_006mak", "source_sha256": "8ae10739a591e6f4d2049283bb5578c4072c0bfd4a5eeaa0362984d3a6cf17f3", "ja": "わざと隙を見せたり、思わせぶりな感じが\nあったり……。刺激のあるところも出せたはずです！", "zh": "故意に露出破绽，或是表现得意味深长……这些富有刺激性的地方，应该也展现出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9004_p", "source_sha256": "85c22e67bcf0500e54e3060b163d7507c238da90ad10682a9e6d1b953c977bc1", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだったよ。さすが、真だな。\nカワイイの極意を追ってるだけあるよ。", "zh": "啊，非常棒。真不愧是你。\n不愧是一直在追求可爱真谛的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9005_006mak", "source_sha256": "06a84cf23c9e02a04f10883a69ee61fe351c82629deae2d6ee589ce149ba6027", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　{$P$}は\nもし、こんな子がいたら夢中になってくれますか？", "zh": "谢谢您♪　{$P$}，\n要是真有这样的女孩子，您会为她着迷吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9006_p", "source_sha256": "5cc00dae1edb1e2bc5222db95d7daea98804b6cc32d412b3d9281d8448a936e3", "ja": "実際にいたら、か……。そうだな。", "zh": "要是现实里真有的话，吗……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9007", "source_sha256": "7fe87bd6f6d786cd96785cbd97b494998157b869342b896a1e08b20d5d195fb0", "ja": "夢中になりそう", "zh": "要入迷了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9008", "source_sha256": "425c872f20933a322acc72b67f642a3a7438c87feab4b6890b4d4fafd7d2beec", "ja": "警戒する", "zh": "提高警惕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9200_p", "source_sha256": "00bf18763082a3225458fdaba09c6a42c6679aeb7bd4f6602bc773aa20288b87", "ja": "夢中になっちゃうかもな。カワイイのもそうだけど\n手の上で転がされる感じにドキドキするというか……。", "zh": "可能会让人着迷吧。虽然可爱也是一方面，\n但总觉得被玩弄于股掌之间的感觉让人心跳加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9201_006mak", "source_sha256": "70fb0843d3ce68079e1c47606960922372b00669af60349f735cde35be1d5c0f", "ja": "たくさんの人を見てきた{$P$}でも\nそうなるんですね。やっぱりカワイイってすごいなぁ。", "zh": "即使是见过许多人的{$P$}，也会变成这样啊。果然，可爱真是不得了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9202_006mak", "source_sha256": "6799cb5b24b3d05773a7ae6db0ada4176f71587906089563e133c8d35b5cc6d6", "ja": "よーし、どんな相手も絶対に魅了できるカワイさが\n出せるように……もっと自分を磨かないとですねっ♪", "zh": "好～，为了能展现出绝对可以迷倒任何人的可爱……\n我必须更加磨练自己才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9300_p", "source_sha256": "00bf18763082a3225458fdaba09c6a42c6679aeb7bd4f6602bc773aa20288b87", "ja": "夢中になっちゃうかもな。カワイイのもそうだけど\n手の上で転がされる感じにドキドキするというか……。", "zh": "可能会让人着迷吧。虽然可爱也是一方面，\n但总觉得被玩弄于股掌之间的感觉让人心跳加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9301_006mak", "source_sha256": "eef02f9779f9538f6b40aa6022b16946f3e5119c9f6a1ed4fcec250c5c178551", "ja": "ですよね！　カワイくて、目が離せなくて、どんどん\n夢中になって、虜になって、他に何も見えなくて……。", "zh": "就是嘛！可爱得让人移不开视线，越来越着迷，彻底被俘获，眼里再也看不到其他东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9302_006mak", "source_sha256": "b24fb62ca7996584f34d0b15664fdac6b734f5bf519d3b23b84efcb7a3e9272c", "ja": "戻れないくらい好きになって……。うう、カワイさの\nすごいところですけど、ちょっと怖さを感じるかも。", "zh": "喜欢到让人无法回头……呜，这就是可爱的厉害之处，不过，也可能会让人觉得有点可怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9500_p", "source_sha256": "c156022f1fb555077fb1692f9bd99b4ce4f63335a5f4c25bcbd5ee591144f951", "ja": "うーん……警戒すると思う。なにか裏がありそうな気が\nするし。懐に入ったら、実は……みたいな。", "zh": "嗯……我可能会提高警惕吧。总觉得背后藏着什么名堂。\n一旦卸下防备，其实……这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9501_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c632148ebb999d3d9d717c502606526e431d155d7fcdbd84ca2b2d772d40f86", "ja": "さすがですね、{$P$}。やっぱり\nたくさんの人を見てきたからこそ、わかるんだろうな。", "zh": "不愧是您，{$P$}。果然是因为见过那么多人，才会明白吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9502_006mak", "source_sha256": "d532a9203926861188b7715cb406bfc6c6adbcdab1feb849c12d7c104583479b", "ja": "ボクは……うまく隠されたら全然わからないかも。\nカワイイ笑顔って、それぐらい魅力的ですからね……！", "zh": "我啊……要是藏得好，可能完全看不出来。  \n毕竟可爱的笑容就是有这么大的魅力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9600_p", "source_sha256": "c156022f1fb555077fb1692f9bd99b4ce4f63335a5f4c25bcbd5ee591144f951", "ja": "うーん……警戒すると思う。なにか裏がありそうな気が\nするし。懐に入ったら、実は……みたいな。", "zh": "嗯……我可能会提高警惕吧。总觉得背后藏着什么名堂。\n一旦卸下防备，其实……这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9601_006mak", "source_sha256": "184cf22dc8e319bdeb85884b818f6f0f6ce3b0e2904ba23c0a102362a8945514", "ja": "あっ。そういう人、漫画でよく見ます！　そっか……。\nカワイイの裏側を気にしないとダメなんですね。", "zh": "啊！漫画里经常能看到那种人！原来如此……不能只看可爱的一面，还得留意背后啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_9602_006mak", "source_sha256": "726ec7dffd95d1411c060a38d4908a472f26d77bef8e81d85bdd0c16452cafdc", "ja": "ううっ。ボクも気をつけないといけないけど……。\nみんなのカワイイを疑うなんて、ボクにできるかな～？", "zh": "呜……我也必须多加注意才行，可是……\n去怀疑大家的可爱之处，我真的做得到吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
